The ground trembles briefly, then stills. A pair of GOLDEN EYES emerge from the shadows, fixing on LITTLERED. A luminous STAG steps forward, exuding an aura of ancient wisdom and silent understanding, its presence mysterious yet comforting in the encroaching darkness.

The stag bows its regal head, nostrils flaring as it surveys the clearing. Its antlers, etched with ancient runes, glimmer in the dim light, casting flickering shadows towards a narrow, overgrown path hidden by dense foliage. This silent gesture implores LittleRed to seek guidance down this hidden trail.

