ing a burden.'}, {'name': 'Lumi', 'role': 'side', 'profile': "for Lumi\n\nName: Lumi \nGender: Female \nAge: 20 \nOccupation: Baker at the Old Bakery \n\nPrimary Strengths: \n- Deeply empathetic and protective, especially towards her sister, Amber. \n- Highly intuitive, often sensing the needs and emotions of others before they are expressed. \n- Skilled in creating warm and comforting atmospheres, both emotionally and physically through her baking.\n\nPrimary Flaws:\n- Overly cautious, sometimes to the point of inhibiting adventure or spontaneity. \n- Prone to anxiety, especially concerning the safety and well-being of loved ones. \n- Struggles with expressing her own needs, leading to feelings of being unappreciated or neglected.\n\nDistinctive Attitude or Behavior:\n- Lumi tends to wrap herself in the warmth of tradition and routine, often baking to express love and care. \n- She watches over others as a guardian figure, sometimes leading to her involvement in situations where others may not seek her help. \n- Lumi's interactions are marked by a nurturing presence, often offering baked goods as peace gestures or tokens of affection.\n\nPast Traumatic Event:\n- The loss of their parents during a winter storm when Lumi was young left a lasting mark, instilling a fear of loss and a drive to fiercely protect Amber.\n\nList of violent or extreme lines/actions the character may exhibit when completely overwhelmed by their key traits:\n- In a panicked state, she might become uncharacteristically controlling, demanding Amber stay close and avoid any risk.\n- If faced with a perceived threat to her sister, Lumi might react with aggressive protectiveness, potentially lashing out verbally to keep others away.\n- When entirely overcome by anxiety, she may shut down, becoming unresponsive to others and retreating entirely into her baking as a coping mechanism.\n\nList of dishonorable actions or reactions the character may take under unavoidable circumstances:\n- In a desperat