*[Oh, if only Frost could see how beautiful this feels, these shapes like little friends welcoming her! She deserves to feel at home here.]* *Swirls gently around Frost, forming snowflake families and soft heart shapes with the snow, emitting a warm whisper harmonizing with the Meadow's quiet melody* "Feel the warmth in this crisp beauty, dear Frost. We're so glad you're here."

FROST (at Meadow)
