er may exhibit when completely overwhelmed by their key traits: When overwhelmed, Sven might charge recklessly, knocking over anything in his path. During moments of intense play or fear, he might accidentally trample food or items. He could snap or snort aggressively if he feels cornered or if someone threatens Kristoff.\nList of dishonorable actions or reactions the character may take under unavoidable circumstances: Sven might eat food meant for everyone in moments of uncontrollable hunger. He could also hide behind Kristoff to avoid taking responsibility for causing any playful mishaps.", 'character_utility': 'utility(Sven):\n\tMaintain a close bond with Kristoff, ensuring his safety and happiness.\n\tEngage in playful and humorous interactions to entertain and bring joy to the group.\n\tOvercome personal fears, especially those related to snowstorms and being alone.\n\tBalance impulsivity with responsibility to avoid creating unintended chaos.\n\tEnjoy feasts and gatherings, participating in communal activities and togetherness.\n\tProtect community by being observant and alert to any potential threats to friends.', 'summarized_profile': "Sven is a young adult reindeer characterized by his loyalty, comedic nature, and empathetic disposition, serving as Kristoff's close companion and transport aid. His impulsiveness and mischievousness can lead to chaos, often expressed through playful gestures that lighten tense moments. Despite his joyous nature, Sven harbors a fear of snowstorms and abandonment due to a traumatic blizzard separation as a calf. His unwavering bond with Kristoff is largely telepathic, completing each other's thoughts. In moments of stress, Sven may act out chaotically, such as charging or trampling, and sometimes shirks responsibility by hiding behind Kristoff."}]
